<title>INDIA: No Colour Chem /Clariant merger.</title>
<headline>No Colour Chem /Clariant merger.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colour-Chem Ltd, a subsidiary of Clariant AG, will not merge with Clariant's other Indian subsidiary Clariant India Ltd in the near future, Colour-Chem chairman B. Hofmann said in the company's 1996/97 annual report.</p>
</text>
